# AWS control-plane tooling kept on the host for interactive authenticated sessions.
# Opt-in. Credentials stay on the host: no container receives them (AGENTS.md).
#
# Every formula below was checked for an x86_64_linux bottle in homebrew-core (ADR-010).
brew "awscli"  # AWS control-plane CLI.
brew "granted" # Issues short-lived, least-privilege SSO sessions per account.
